[26.074, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mCalling Bash 3 times…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[26.774, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Surveying…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(41s · ↓ 3.2k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[28.774, "o", "\r\n"]
[29.324, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m The survey explains the weekend: no NFS-backed workload has a liveness\r\n"]
[30.224, "o", "  probe at all. Grafana and loki are readiness-only — NotReady forever,\r\n"]
[31.024, "o", "  never restarted. Everything else has nothing.\r\n"]
[32.424, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Verifying each endpoint against the running pods, not the docs.\r\n"]
[33.524, "o", "\r\n"]
[34.074, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mCalling Edit 9 times…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[34.774, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Writing probes…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(6m 18s · ↓ 24.1k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[36.774, "o", "\r\n"]
[37.324, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;114m9 manifests validated (server-side dry run)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[38.924, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Probes must reach the data layer: grafana /api/health reports the DB,\r\n"]
[39.824, "o", "  n8n gets the DB-checking endpoint, nginx reads a real file off the\r\n"]
[40.624, "o", "  volume. Mongo's ping answers from memory — paired with a file check.\r\n"]
